{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, move, check properties and perform specific task, then grab it or scan area if needed. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
